## 8. Never do this (scannable checklist)

- [ ] ❌ Hardcoded hex / rgb / hsl / oklch colours in a component, `style` prop, or arbitrary class.
- [ ] ❌ Raw Tailwind palette classes (`bg-blue-500`, `text-neutral-800`, `bg-white`, `text-black`).
- [ ] ❌ Arbitrary pixel spacing or sizing (`mt-[13px]`, `w-[342px]`) or one-off radius (`rounded-[6px]`).
- [ ] ❌ Any icon library other than `lucide-react`.
- [ ] ❌ Any animation library beyond `framer-motion` (once approved) and the installed `tw-animate-css`.
- [ ] ❌ A shared component that fetches its own data.
- [ ] ❌ A shared component without explicit loading, empty and error handling, or one that silently `return null`s.
- [ ] ❌ Animating layout-affecting CSS properties (`width`, `height`, `top`, `left`, margins, padding).
- [ ] ❌ Ignoring `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- [ ] ❌ A component over ~300 lines (matches `.cursorrules`).
- [ ] ❌ Scattered `if`/ternary chains on a discriminator instead of one config map; `className` ternary chains
      instead of `cva` for more than two variants.
- [ ] ❌ A client-only fetch for the server-rendered intent header; more than one prioritised image per screen;
      the deprecated `priority` prop on `next/image`.
- [ ] ❌ An async region without a geometry-matched `Skeleton`; fonts loaded outside `next/font`.
- [ ] ❌ An undebounced search input that fetches or updates the URL per keystroke.
- [ ] ❌ Grade, type or state conveyed by colour alone; a suppressed focus ring.
- [ ] ❌ A locally overridden design token, or a `tailwind.config.*` file.
